                implementation.scheduler).ownPlay who trace) *
            (∏ owner ∈ Finset.univ.erase who, ∏ index, (classes owner index).toReal) *
            (∏ owner ∈ Finset.univ.erase who, ∏ index, (aliases owner index).toReal) := by
